      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>An autumn mushroom with a fanged mouth and a varying number of eyes. Mycotoxins often use pollen to sleep their targets and nausea powder to weaken them after.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 17, touch 14, flat-footed 14 (+3 dex, +3 natural, +1 size)</p><p>HP 66 [91] (7d8+35)</p><p>Fort +9, Reflex +5, Will +4</p><p>Immune plant traits; Resist Earth 10, Ice 5, Water 10</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +9 (1d6+1 plus poison), 2 Slams +4 (1d3 plus poison)</p><p>Special Attacks Dream Pollen, Nausea Powder</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 13, Dex 16, Con 18, Int 7, Wis 14, Cha 17</p><p>Base Atk +5; CMB +5; CMD 18</p><p>Feats Blind-Fight, Power Attack, Toughness, Weapon Finesse</p><p>Skills Stealth +15 (+19 in swamps and underground), Survival +3 (+7 in swamps and underground), Perception +3; Racial Modifiers +4 Stealth and Survival in swamps and underground</p>"
